UID:5f2b14da2854f7de45f0d773@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:🟠 November opens with Venus and Mercury both turning direct
  within days of each other\, both in your house of partners: any conversat
 ion or decision about a relationship or deal that felt stuck finally start
 s to move\, though slowly at first since both retrace their steps through 
 December. Mercury's stationary point lands exactly on your natal North Nod
 e\, marking a real turning point about which direction your relationships 
 are heading. Jupiter joins your natal Mars on November 7\, giving a fresh 
 burst of energy to your creativity and self-expression right as a new Mars
  cycle begins on your own degree. The New Moon on November 9 opens a chapt
 er about shared resources and deep transformation\, echoed by the Full Moo
 n on November 24 in your house of money and talents\, which faces your nat
 al Mercury and brings a clear truth about your own worth full circle. The 
 Sun's move into your house of shared resources on the 1st\, then into Sagi
 ttarius on the 22nd\, keeps pushing you to talk more openly about what you
  owe or share with others.\n\nIn the background\, Saturn's conjunction to 
 your natal Venus and Ascendant is this month's main theme: a brand-new cyc
 le about love\, self-worth and how you show up to the world is just beginn
 ing to take root\, not closing anything yet. Neptune keeps pushing a first
  square to your natal Midheaven\, a long-inherited theme about your career
  and public image that asks you to build something real out of an old fami
 ly pattern. Uranus starts a new cycle conjunct your natal Mercury\, rewiri
 ng how you think and value your own mind. Saturn's last square to your nat
 al Moon asks you to review what began back in 2004\, around age 9\, about 
 home and emotional security. Jupiter opens a new cycle with your natal Mar
 s around creativity and desire\, while Pluto's first square to your natal 
 North Node keeps building tension around your path in partnerships. Saturn
 's square to your natal Midheaven\, now separating\, leaves a final lesson
  about career structure\, and Neptune's distant conjunction to your natal 
 Ascendant quietly begins to soften how you see your own identity.\n\nYou w
 ill find more information and detail in the events of November in your cal
 endar. Happy November! ✨\n\n—\nIris Calendar\n🍓 Updated on 08 Oct 2
 026\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
